From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:26:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): patch 09-11-2026 - Epochal Advent and Anastasya v2

Artifact set:
- Remnants of the Origin is renamed Epochal Advent (key EpochalAdvent),
  with its piece names. Artifacts and TC builds saved with the old key
  get the new one when loaded.
- The 4-piece effect only applies while the wielder is the on-field
  character; its description no longer says it works off-field.

Anastasya (v2 kit):
- Blessed Armament: Dekhomenon is now Blessed Spear: Dolgomernoye, and
  Blessed Armament is Blessed Spear, in her texts and C2 effect name.
- Palestar Crown Stellar-Conduct/Stellar Swirl DMG: 60.5%/90.7% at
  Lv. 10 (all levels x0.84).
- To the New World Stellar Glimmer Reaction DMG Increase: 30% at
  Lv. 10 (all levels x0.6), so the party buff is 30%.
- C1 text: "the equal division of Accolades"; Palestar Edict: Doom's
  third stage ends the Blessed target's freeze effect.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
